   * @x-autobe-specification Validate the refresh token or session renewal proof from an existing guest session, confirm that the session is still valid and unexpired, and issue a new JWT token set. The implementation should use the guest session store to verify the refresh context, rotate or extend session state according to security policy, and reject revoked, expired, or malformed refresh requests. Refresh should not create a new guest identity unless the refresh payload explicitly requires session rehydration.
